---
description: Licence and clean-room rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Never create, open, read or import anything under enterprise/. The folder is deleted from this fork. If it reappears after a sync, run scripts/fizot/remove-enterprise.mjs and stop.
- Keep LICENSE, NOTICE, LICENSING.md and CLA.md unchanged.
- Build the Fizot Admin only from docs/cloud-pro.md, docs/team-cloud.md and the Apache server code. Record the docs commit SHA used.
- Never set OMB_ADMIN_URL, OMB_ADMIN_WORKSPACE or OMB_ADMIN_MEMBERSHIP on a Fizot machine.
- No upstream product name, logo, mascot or domain in anything a user can see.
- Any new hostname must be classified in brand/allowed-hosts.json with a reason before merge.
